    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_MC02_15_03_00_Novel_00021_YIzumi",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "It's not our fault you're getting made fun of when you act the way you do all the time. You reap what you sow.",
